The probes exposed three gaps. The async runner accepted the same Tix rewrite without running its Tix gate. A native pass with an explicit store hit `ir.unpublished`. And the differential cache reused a stale baseline outcome when a deliberately invalid key named two baselines that generated identical cases. I also found a second synchronous strategy implementation in T6-H.
